    {
      "block_id": "BL-6137-2.1.02-06",
      "block_type": "worked_application",
      "heading": "",
      "text": "Energy is needed for machinery, lighting, refrigeration and other processes. A fish plant can be particularly sensitive to interruptions in cold storage and freezing. Reliable supply can protect product quality and reduce downtime, while the tariff affects operating costs. A site with low advertised energy prices may be less attractive if interruptions create costly losses or require expensive backup. Distinguish the availability, reliability and price aspects rather than treating power as one undifferentiated word. The relevant requirement depends on the equipment and process shown in the resource.",
      "claim_ids": [
        "CL-6137-2.1.02-1",
        "CL-6137-2.1.02-2",
        "CL-6137-2.1.02-01-1",
        "CL-6137-2.1.02-01-2",
