      "block_id": "BL-6137-2.1.02-20",
      "block_type": "worked_application",
      "heading": "",
      "text": "A cost comparison can develop the location reasoning. Suppose the same proposed output at site A involves monthly raw-material delivery of N$48,000, finished-product transport of N$12,000 and energy of N$20,000. The corresponding stated costs at B are N$74,000, N$9,000 and N$18,000. The three specified costs total N$80,000 at A and N$101,000 at B, a N$21,000 difference. A's energy and finished-transport costs are higher, but its raw-material-delivery advantage more than offsets them within this limited comparison. The result supports a cost advantage on those stated items, not a guaranteed profit or a complete site recommendation.",
      "claim_ids": [
        "CL-6137-2.1.02-1",
        "CL-6137-2.1.02-2",
        "CL-6137-2.1.02-01-1",
